        ["M1", "Revisit\n재방문",
         "logit P(Revisit) = β₀ + x′β + δⱼ\nWho comes back to the same place",
         THEME.colors.accent1],
        ["M2", "Keyword tags\n키워드 수",
         "Ordered logit over 0-5 tags, proportional odds\nWho contributes more information",
