        { text: `Cross-lingual similarity of the two topic profiles stays between ${fmt(simLo)} and ${fmt(simHi)} across places: the two groups are describing the same attractions, which is what makes the dictionary contrasts interpretable.`, options: { bullet: true, breakLine: true } },
        { text: `교차언어 유사도는 ${fmt(simLo)}~${fmt(simHi)} 범위로, 두 집단이 동일한 대상을 서술하고 있음을 확인한다.`, options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 11.5, color: "6E8288" } }
    ], {
